Ts, relays, and battery.



Questions from ES Estimating Group as the PM team has requested a revised e=
stimate based on the most recent scope :

Please check the dollar amount below, all from previous estimate E-23-373.

  1.  Battery System - $12,106,850.  - no  this is for the 12 Nomad Voyager=
 Eagle LFP BESS Systems $12 million.

