in the Breaker estimate
  1.  Transportation/Spare Parts - $585,688. - I will remove from estimate
     *   unknown

  1.  Battery labor - $2,553,828, 16,801 mhrs is this for the entire new SS=
 or just for the batteries?

     *   Not sure what this is - Estimate E-23-373, labor amount 16,801 man=
-hours for installation.  Are the 16,801 man-hours for the install of the b=
atteries only or for the install of the entire SS.   Does not say in the es=
timate.  I have the labor man-hours for the SS equipment, but I do not know=
 how much labor man-hours to charge to the install of the batteries.

  1.  PCS Units - $832,022 is this for the batteries or is this the cost fo=
r the five outdoor standalone feeder cabinets?

     *   Not sure what this is =96 may be a carry over for the PCS for the =
BESS - ok will remove from the estimate.  I do have costs for the five feed=
er control cabinets.

  1.  Step up transformers - $630,371.

     *   Is this Station Service Transformers or GSUs? - GSUs is this amoun=
t correct?  E-23-373 estimate had this amount.

  1.  Site Sound Mitigation - $466,766 - is this done? Do I need to include=
 the estimate?

     *   I would carry this as a risk item if its needed or not - OK

  1.  Rental - Spot Generator - $139,700 - Did not see in scope but is incl=
uded in est. E-23-373, Include in Est. or not?

     *   I don=92t this this is needed =96 we are going to put station serv=
ice transforms in first so we should be good - I will remove from estimate.

Other questions:

  1.  Is it an overhead cable or bus from the wood riser pole to the Siemen=
s Breaker? Size and length?
     *   Overhead cable -25=92 per phase should cover us on both sides of t=
he breaker - Thank you!
  2.  The three SSVT pad mount transformers, I added three riser structures=
 with foundations. Also add UG cable, 500LF per SSVT.  Let me know if you a=
gree with this.

     *   Should be down to 1 Station Service Transformer pad mount.  500=92=
 is plenty - Ok, scope has two pad mount SSVT at 1500 kVA each and one pad =
