  1.  On the eight wood riser poles, are the breaker disconnect switches lo=
cated on these poles?

     *   Breaker Disconnects are on the skid for the breaker - Excellent th=
ank you

  1.  PTs (8 locations each side of the Siemens breaker, 24 total) - are th=
ey installed on the wood riser poles? or on their own steel supports?

     *   PTs are on the breaker skid - Thank you



